{"resourceIdentifier":"4938","resourceName":"Chiping Municipal Solid Waste Incineration For Power Generation Project","description":"Chiping Municipal Solid Waste Incineration For Power Generation Project will use the waste incineration boilers to incinerate the MSW to produce high- temperature gas; then, the high-temperature gas will drive the turbo generator set to generate electricity. \r\nThe Owner of the Project is Chiping Guohuan Renewable Energy Co., Ltd. The  project owner has obtained approval from the Liaocheng Development and Reform Commission for the construction and operation of the Project. \r\nThe project is designed to dispose of a daily average of 600 tons of MSW through two incineration systems, each with the treatment capacity of 600 tons/d of MSW, matched with one set of 12 MW condensing turbine and one set of 12 MW turbo generators.\r\nThe project will dispose of 219,000 tons of MSW every year, and consume 210 tons of light diesel as auxiliary fuel every year. The expected average electricity generation will be 96,000 MWh per year, of                                           which 75,168 MWh will be delivered to the North China Grid Company Limited(NCGC).\r\nThe electricity generated by this project, except for the self-consumption power of the plant, the rest electricity will be supplied to the NCGC via 110kV Shuangan  Substation.","location":{"latitude":36.601684,"longitude":116.339066},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-08-13","endExclusive":"2024-09-13","endInclusive":"2024-09-12"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4938"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shandong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Chiping Guohuan Renewable Energy Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Shandong Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"s